### 2. Guards Module

**Primary Module** - Most comprehensive with 12+ sub-pages

#### 2.1 Add New Guard
**URL**: `/guard/create`

**Form Sections**:

**Pre-Requisites Checklist**:
- NADRA Verification
- Health Certificate
- Police Verification
- Eyesight Certificate
- Character Verification
- Mental Health Check
- 3rd Guarantor Verification
- Company Card & CNIC

**Regional Office**:
- Assignment to administrative branch

**Personal Information**:
- Name, CNIC, Contact
- Date of Birth, Age
- Father's Name, Religion
- Marital Status, Education
- Address (Permanent, Current)
- Emergency Contact

**Ex-Service Details** (for veterans):
- Rank
- Regiment
- Service Period
- Discharge Type

**Educational Details**:
- Qualification
- Institution
- Year

**Bank Details**:
- Bank Name
- Account Number
- Account Type
- Branch Code

#### 2.2 Search Guard
**URL**: `/guard/search`

**Search Filters**:
- Parwest ID (text input)
- Name (text input)
- CNIC# (text input)
- Phone Number (text input)
- Education (dropdown)
- Religion (dropdown)
- Status (dropdown: Pending, Active, etc.)
- Client (dropdown)
- Supervisor (dropdown)
- Ex-Service (dropdown)
- Verification Type (dropdown)
- Verification Status (dropdown)
- Created From/To (date range)
- Bank Name (dropdown)
- Bank Account Status (dropdown)
- Bank Card Status (dropdown)
- Bank Account Type (dropdown)
- Residence (dropdown)
- Over Staying (checkbox)
- On Night Duty (checkbox)
- Terminated Records (checkbox)

**Table Columns**:
- Parwest ID
- Name (clickable)
- CNIC Number
- Joining Date
- Status

**Actions**:
- View (eye icon)
- Edit (pencil icon)
- Delete (trash icon)

**Export Options**:
- Export Short Role in Excel
- Export in Bank Details
- Export in Excel

#### 2.3 Export Guard
**URL**: `/guard/export`

**Purpose**: Bulk export of guard data with custom filters

#### 2.4 Prerequisites
**URL**: `/guard/prerequisites/index`

**Management of**:
- NADRA verification records
- Health certificates
- Police verification
- Other prerequisite documents

#### 2.5 Black Listed
**URL**: `/guard/blacklist`

**Features**:
- Search by CNIC
- Add CNIC to blacklist (identity-level, not guard-record selection)
- Record who blacklisted and when
- Reason for blacklisting
