#### 2.8 Deployments Rate
**URL**: `/guard/deployments-rate`

**Purpose**: Monitor deployment efficiency and rates

#### 2.9 Attendance
**URL**: `/guard/attendance`

**Purpose**: Track guard physical presence at assigned sites

#### 2.10 Client Attendance
**URL**: `/guard/client-attendance`

**Purpose**: Client-specific attendance tracking

#### 2.11 Residences
**URL**: `/guard/residences`

**Purpose**: Management of guard housing

