## Data Models & Relationships

### Core Entities

#### Guard
```
- id (Primary Key)
- parwest_id (Unique Identifier)
- name
- cnic (National ID)
- phone
- email
- date_of_birth
- age
- father_name
- religion
- marital_status
- education
- address_permanent
- address_current
- emergency_contact
- regional_office_id (Foreign Key)
- status (Pending, Active, Inactive, Terminated)
- is_ex_service (Boolean)
- ex_service_rank
- ex_service_regiment
- bank_name
- bank_account_number
- bank_account_type
- created_at
- updated_at
```

**Relationships**:
- Belongs to Regional Office
- Has many Deployments
- Has many Attendance Records
- Has many Payroll Records
- Has many Inventory Assignments
- Has many Prerequisites
- Has one Residence Assignment

#### Client
```
- id (Primary Key)
- name
- email
- type (Bank, Manufacturer, etc.)
- enrollment_date
- is_branchless (Boolean)
- head_office_address
- city
- status (Active, Inactive)
- logo_url
- ntn (National Tax Number)
- strn (Sales Tax Registration)
- created_at
- updated_at
```

**Relationships**:
- Has many Branches
- Has many Deployments
- Has many Pricing Configurations
- Has many Inventory Assignments
- Has many Invoices

#### Branch
```
- id (Primary Key)
- client_id (Foreign Key)
- name
- address
- city
- contact_person
- contact_number
- created_at
- updated_at
```

**Relationships**:
- Belongs to Client
- Has many Deployments

#### Deployment
```
- id (Primary Key)
- guard_id (Foreign Key)
- client_id (Foreign Key)
- branch_id (Foreign Key)
- regional_office_id (Foreign Key)
- designation
- deployment_date
- shift_type (Day, Night)
- rate
- status (Active, Inactive)
- created_at
- updated_at
```

**Relationships**:
- Belongs to Guard
- Belongs to Client
- Belongs to Branch
- Belongs to Regional Office

#### Payroll
```
- id (Primary Key)
- guard_id (Foreign Key)
- month
- year
- regional_office_id (Foreign Key)
- client_id (Foreign Key)
- branch_id (Foreign Key)
- deployment_days
- base_salary
- extra_hours
- extra_hours_amount
- special_duty_hours
- special_duty_amount
- loans
- other_deductions
- training_school_fees
- cwf
- eobi
- essi
- net_salary
- payment_status (Pending, Paid, Unpaid)
- payment_method (Bank, Cash, Mobile)
- created_at
- updated_at
```

**Relationships**:
- Belongs to Guard
- Belongs to Regional Office
- Belongs to Client
- Belongs to Branch

#### Inventory
```
- id (Primary Key)
- category_id (Foreign Key)
- product_type_id (Foreign Key)
- vendor_id (Foreign Key)
- unique_number
- serial_number
- order_id
- price
- purchase_date
- expiry_date
- warranty_time
- warranty_type
- size
- weight
- length
- width
- color
- is_insured (Boolean)
- is_non_unique (Boolean)
- quantity
- status (Available, Issued, Condemned)
- license_number
- regional_office_id (Foreign Key)
- created_at
- updated_at
```

**Relationships**:
- Belongs to Category
- Belongs to Product Type
- Belongs to Vendor
- Belongs to Regional Office
- Has many Assignments (to Guards or Clients)

#### User
```
- id (Primary Key)
- name
- email (Unique)
- password (Hashed)
- role_id (Foreign Key)
- regional_office_id (Foreign Key)
- region_id (Foreign Key)
- contact_number
- photo_url
- status (Active, Inactive)
- created_at
- updated_at
```

**Relationships**:
- Belongs to Role
- Belongs to Regional Office
- Belongs to Region
- Has many Permissions
- Has many Status History Records

#### Ticket
```
- id (Primary Key)
- subject
- description
- sender_id (Foreign Key to User)
- assigned_to_id (Foreign Key to User)
- category_id (Foreign Key)
- priority_id (Foreign Key)
- status_id (Foreign Key)
- created_at
- updated_at
```

**Relationships**:
- Belongs to Sender (User)
- Belongs to Assigned User
- Belongs to Category
- Belongs to Priority
- Belongs to Status

### Lookup Tables

- **Regional Offices**
- **Regions**
- **User Roles**
- **Client Types**
- **Inventory Categories**
- **Inventory Product Types**
- **Inventory Vendors**
- **Inventory Conditions**
- **Ticket Categories**
- **Ticket Priorities**
- **Ticket Statuses**
- **Guard Pledgeable Document Types**

