## Key Workflows

### 1. Guard Onboarding Workflow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Start: Add New Guard] --> B[Fill Personal Information]
    B --> C[Upload Prerequisites Documents]
    C --> D[Verify Prerequisites]
    D --> E{All Prerequisites Met?}
    E -->|No| F[Mark as Pending]
    E -->|Yes| G[Submit to Requisitions]
    G --> H[Head Office Review]
    H --> I{Approved?}
    I -->|No| J[Rejected]
    I -->|Yes| K[Mark as Active]
    K --> L[Assign to Regional Office]
    L --> M[Ready for Deployment]
```

### 2. Guard Deployment Workflow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Start: Deploy Guards] --> B[Select Region]
    B --> C[Select Client]
    C --> D[Select Branch]
    D --> E[Select Designation]
    E --> F[Select Guard from Active Pool]
    F --> G[Set Deployment Date]
    G --> H[Set Shift Type]
    H --> I[Set Rate/Pricing]
    I --> J[Confirm Deployment]
    J --> K[Update Guard Status]
    K --> L[Notify Supervisor]
```

### 3. Payroll Processing Workflow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Start: Month Initialise] --> B[Close Previous Month]
    B --> C[Initialize New Month]
    C --> D[Record Extra Hours]
    D --> E[Record Special Duties]
    E --> F[Record Loans]
    F --> G[Record Other Deductions]
    G --> H[Calculate Salary]
    H --> I[Select Region/Client/Branch]
    I --> J[Run Salary Calculation]
    J --> K[Review Salary Summary]
    K --> L{Approve?}
    L -->|No| M[Adjust Entries]
    M --> H
    L -->|Yes| N[Finalize Payroll]
    N --> O[Generate Salary Slips]
    O --> P[Export Bank Transfer Sheet]
    P --> Q[Process Payments]
    Q --> R[Mark as Paid]
```

### 4. Client Onboarding Workflow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Start: Add New Client] --> B[Fill Basic Information]
    B --> C[Upload Compliance Documents]
    C --> D[Define Operational Territory]
    D --> E{Is Branchless?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Single Location Setup]
    E -->|No| G[Add Multiple Branches]
    G --> H[Configure Pricing per Branch]
    F --> I[Configure Pricing]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Assign Weapons if Required]
    J --> K[Set Invoice Prerequisites]
    K --> L[Activate Client]
    L --> M[Ready for Guard Deployment]
```

### 5. Inventory Assignment Workflow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Start: Assign Item] --> B{Assign to Client or Guard?}
    B -->|Client| C[Select Regional Office]
    B -->|Guard| D[Select Regional Office]
    C --> E[Select Category]
    D --> E
    E --> F[Select Specific Client/Guard]
    F --> G[Select Item from Available Stock]
    G --> H[Record Assignment]
    H --> I[Update Item Status to Issued]
    I --> J[Generate Assignment Receipt]
```

### 6. Ticket Management Workflow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Create Ticket] --> B[Set Subject & Description]
    B --> C[Select Category]
    C --> D[Set Priority]
    D --> E[Submit Ticket]
    E --> F[Status: New]
    F --> G[Assign to User]
    G --> H[Status: Open]
    H --> I[Work on Ticket]
    I --> J[Status: In-Progress]
    J --> K{Resolved?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Status: Closed Successfully]
    K -->|No| M[Status: Closed Unresolved]
```

